      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok fine i'll call them if i have to... but honestly i'm just looking for a quick way to stop the cramps tonight. i saw some high strength potassium pills at the pharmacy that say they are great for muscle recovery. if i just take one of those extra strong ones once before bed, is that really gonna kill me? i feel fine otherwise.",
